  "description": "Keep a pulse on your system — right from your desktop. Perf Counter delivers real-time hardware monitoring at a glance.\n\n          • Live CPU & RAM utilization across all cores\n          • CPU & GPU temperature monitoring\n          • Refreshes every second for up-to-the-moment stats\n          • Configurable display settings to fit your workflow\n          • One-click access to Task Manager when you need to dig deeper\n\n          Lightweight, always visible, and endlessly useful.",
